  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Burkina Faso&#x2019;s Border Management Capabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to sustainably enhance border security by improving the technical capacities of the Burkina Faso Border Police. This aim is to be achieved notably by the installation of the MIDAS system in three border posts between Burkina Faso and Ghana and Burkina Faso and Ivory Coast (Kosso, Hamele and Lan).</narrative>
  </description>
